  "text": [
    "The lake was very rough last week.",
    "Very few boats made it out onto the water.",
    "The rough weather made it difficult for any boats that ventured out.",
    "Pier fishing was also hampered by the lake conditions.",
    "There were a couple of days when anglers managed to get out.",
    "A few kings and steelhead were caught, but overall, fishing was slow.",
    "Most of the fish were caught by casting spoons.",
    "No perch boats made it out during the week."
